<title>USA: AMEX, CBOE to list TCI Satellite Entertainment.</title>
<headline>AMEX, CBOE to list TCI Satellite Entertainment.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) and the Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said Tuesday they would list options on the over-the-counter stock TCI Satellite Entertainment Thursday, December 5.</p>
<p>The options will trade on the January expiration cycle, with expirations in December, January, April and July. Initial strike prices were set at 15, 17-1/2, and 20. CBOE specialist will be Group One and AMEX's specialist will be Susquehanna Investment Group.</p>
<p>--Chicago Derivatives Desk</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
